%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">일정을 변경</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> 개최한다하오니 관심있는 학생은 참여하시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-LEFT: 50pt\" class=\"HStyle2\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">1. 행사명 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">대학생과 도민이 함께하는 저출산 극복 프로젝트</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-LEFT: 50pt\" class=\"HStyle2\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: -1.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;“</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '새굴림'; LETTER-SPACING: -1.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">동go</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '새굴림'; LETTER-SPACING: -1.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">!</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '새굴림'; LETTER-SPACING: -1.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> 동rock</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '새굴림'; LETTER-SPACING: -1.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">!</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '새굴림'; LETTER-SPACING: -1.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: -1.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">개사가요제”</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-LEFT: 50pt\" class=\"HStyle2\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: -1.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2. 일&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 정</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-LEFT: 50pt\" class=\"HStyle2\">&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; P